RequestContextImpl` is thrown as result of trying to do a call via MP-RestClient.\r\n\r\nWe see this issue since switching to Quarkus-resteasy-reactive from Resteasy-classic.\r\n\r\nIt turns out that the OpenTelemetry dependencies in the POM cause the failure\r\n\r\n        <dependency>\r\n            <groupId>io.quarkus</groupId>\r\n            <artifactId>quarkus-opentelemetry</artifactId>\r\n        </dependency>\r\n        <dependency>\r\n            <groupId>io.quarkus</groupId>\r\n            <artifactId>quarkus-opentelemetry-exporter-jaeger</artifactId>\r\n        </dependency>\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n\r\nLink to a small reproducer (preferably a Maven project if the issue is not Gradle-specific).\r\n\r\n1. build / verify https://github.com/pilhuhn/notifications-backend/tree/089bcbd464d2d713e2abad715fe91b93c687965f\r\n2. see tests fail with code 401\r\n3. remove opentelemetries dependencies from pom\r\n4. rebuild / verify\r\n5. See tests pass\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n\r\n1.13.4\r\n\r\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\r\n\r\nmvn 3.8.1\r\n\r\ncc @kenfinnigan ","closed_by":{"login":"kenfinnigan","id":441240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTI0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/441240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan","html_url":"https://github.com/kenfinnigan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"htt